sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant DT as DownloadTab
    participant FTC as FileTransferClient
    participant PS as PeerServer
    participant CH as ClientHandler
    participant FS as FileScanner
    User->>DT: Select Peer / Click Refresh files
    DT->>FTC: Task -> listRemoteFiles(peer)
    FTC->>PS: TCP Connect (3s timeout)
    PS->>CH: Spawn ClientHandler thread
    FTC->>CH: "LIST\n"
    CH->>FS: scan()
    FS-->>CH: List<SharedFile> (filtered <= 100 MiB)
    CH-->>FTC: "OK <count>\n" + "<name>|<size>|<date>\n"
    FTC-->>DT: List<SharedFile>
    DT-->>User: Populate TableView
